        "MailContent": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_UI_J.ST_UI_J",
          "Key": "Forkshop_4",
          "SourceString": "亲爱的异象猎人，因背包没有足够的空间，您在参与弧盘研募计划时部分道具没有获得，现已将道具送至您的账户。异象猎人公会感谢您的支持，期待与您的再次合作。",
          "LocalizedString": "Dear Anomaly Hunter, some items from your participation in the Arc Research Program could not be collected due to insufficient inventory space. They have now been sent to your account. The Anomaly Hunter Guild thanks you for your support and looks forward to working with you again."
        },
