          "LocalizedString": "Dear Anomaly Hunter, due to interference from an Anomaly, a duplicate purchase occurred when you bought the Honor Hunter Supplies. The Riftcrystals from the duplicate payment has been refunded to your account. The Anomaly Hunter Guild thanks you for your support and looks forward to working with you again."
